@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam ArrowColor #C62828
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #C62828
skinparam ArrowThickness 2title Edit a student's group labels
box "Logic" #C8C8FA
participant ":LogicManager" as Logic LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddressBookParser" as Parser LOGIC_COLOR
participant "edit:EditCommand" as Command LOGIC_COLOR
end box
box "Model" #F97181
participant "pending:ModelManager" as Pending MODEL_COLOR
end box
[-> Logic : Replace tutorial 1 with tutorial 2
activate Logic
Logic -> Parser : Parse command
activate Parser
Parser --> Logic : Edit command
deactivate Parser
Logic -> Pending : Create pending copy
Pending --> Logic : Pending model
Logic -> Command : Execute on pending model
activate Command
Command -> Pending : Read all students
Pending --> Command : Student list
Command -> Command : Find student by ID
Command -> Command : Remove tutorial 1; add tutorial 2
note over Command
Keep Student ID, attendance, and
fields not supplied in the command.
end note
Command -> Pending : Replace student's record
Command -> Pending : Show full student list
Command --> Logic : Edit result
deactivate Command
ref over Logic, Pending : Save before publishing (shared flow)
[<-- Logic : Result
deactivate Logic
@enduml
